@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* The dialog host every FluentUI <c>IDialogService</c> dialog renders into (the mobile card's
   confirm-gated delete uses it). Without a provider the dialog service has nowhere to display.
   Self-closing at the layout root: <c>FluentProviders</c> has no ChildContent parameter and
   renders only its own provider set, so it must never wrap other markup. *@
<FluentProviders />

@* The layout root — the one element carrying THIS component's CSS-isolation scope, which is what
   makes MainLayout.razor.css able to own the host's safe-area insets: an element rendered by a child
   component receives the CHILD's scope attribute, so `@Body` alone can never match a rule authored
   here (the same rule Admin's MainLayout documents for its own layout divs). *@
<div class="layout-root">
    @Body
</div>
